# ── Unreal: generated / regenerable ───────────────────────────────
# Delete any of these and the engine rebuilds them. Never commit them.
#   Binaries/         compiled DLLs and the editor module
#   Intermediate/     build artifacts + generated headers (*.generated.h)
#   DerivedDataCache/ cooked asset cache (shaders, etc.)
#   Saved/            logs, autosaves, crash reports, editor layout
#   Build/            packaging output
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
Build/

# ── Unreal: editor housekeeping ───────────────────────────────────
# Backup/ holds the editor's autosave copies of assets.
Backup/

# ── IDE / toolchain ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Solution files are regenerated by right-clicking the .uproject
# and choosing "Generate Visual Studio project files".
.vs/
.vscode/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.code-workspace
UpgradeLog.htm

# ── Claude Code local state ───────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
